<title>MOROCCO: PRESS DIGEST - Morocco - Oct 27.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Morocco - Oct 27.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Moroccan press on Sunday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>AL MAGHRIB</p>
<p>- The authorities outline strategy to develop fishing and shipping sectors by 2000.</p>
<p>L'OPINION</p>
<p>- Dutch interior minister due in Morocco next week.</p>
<p>RISSALAT AL OUMA</p>
<p>- Political parties back draft law over regions.</p>
<p>AL ALAM</p>
<p>- Germany bans some imports from France. Will Morocco do the same after outbreak of mad cow disease in France?</p>
